# EDITOR COMMENT 1 - FIGURE 8D
#
# PREDICTED MICRONUTRIENT INDEX (MiNI)
# ELASTICNET + IDW INTERPOLATION
#
# OUTPUT:
# 1. 900 dpi TIFF
# 2. 900 dpi PNG
# 3. Vector PDF
#
# EDITOR-REQUESTED IMPROVEMENTS:
# - Larger panel label
